          },
          {
            "text": "Please list your city and country.",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f7"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
          {
            "text": "We're only looking for Senior+ engineers at the moment.",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f10",
              "f11"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
          {
            "text": "Please limit your answer to no more than three paragraphs.",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f12"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
          {
            "text": "Answer 1 of 3 Questions",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f13",
              "f14",
              "f15"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
          {
            "text": "We’d like you to answer only one of the three questions in this section. Answer the one you feel has the strongest answer. Limit your answer to four paragraphs or less. Please do not answer more than one - we will reject candidates who do.",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f13",
              "f14",
              "f15"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
          {
            "text": "We're interested in what made your approach different, why you believed in it, and how you brought others along. Don't feel the need to focus on the technical specificities. Instead, share the journey and ultimate impacts of your decision. Did it shift how your team thought about the problem?",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f13"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
          {
            "text": "We want to understand who the users were, what was being asked of you and why, and how you identified the opportunity to do better. Walk us through how you made your case, what gave you confidence in your position, and what the outcome was — including what was (or wasn’t) shipped.",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f14"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
          {
            "text": "This doesn't need to be a formal project, but we'd ask that it has a professional context: a problem, a pattern, or a question that kept nagging at you. What was the thread you pulled, where did it lead, and what did you do with what you found?",
            "fieldRefs": [
              "f15"
            ],
            "relation": "container"
          },
